don't complement each other.

224
00:09:36,034 --> 00:09:37,285
Eucalyptus and chamomile?

225
00:09:37,327 --> 00:09:38,745
Oh!

226
00:09:38,786 --> 00:09:40,288
What?

227
00:09:40,330 --> 00:09:45,168
The bath salts...
they're starting to effervesce.

228
00:09:45,210 --> 00:09:47,462
It's different.

229
00:09:47,504 --> 00:09:49,506
It's interesting.

230
00:09:51,591 --> 00:09:53,468
Okay, let's talk
about something else.

231
00:09:53,510 --> 00:09:55,011
Yeah, sure, sure.

232
00:09:55,053 --> 00:09:56,846
So, what was going on
with you today?

233
00:09:56,888 --> 00:09:59,182
Oh-oh-oh!

234
00:09:59,224 --> 00:10:03,186
Well, I actually
had the weirdest
conversation with Joey.

235
00:10:03,228 --> 00:10:06,981
He was talking about rules
and right and wrong and...

236
00:10:07,023 --> 00:10:09,025
