conversation.

237
00:10:09,067 --> 00:10:11,194
You did? What was
he talking about?

238
00:10:11,236 --> 00:10:13,488
I don't know, Joey hasn't had
this much trouble

239
00:10:13,530 --> 00:10:15,740
